Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         gnome-shell (>= 46~),
         gnome-shell-common
Description: 13-month Real Calendar for the GNOME date menu
 Real Calendar adds the International Fixed Calendar (13 months of 28 days,
 extra month Sol, Year Day and Leap Day) to the GNOME top-bar date menu.
 .
 Each month maps to one of thirteen zodiac signs, including Ophiuchus.
 Non-zero clock digits show 369 time meanings under the zodiac line.
 .
 Toggle between Gregorian and Real in the date menu, or replace the default
 calendar from the extension settings. The 24-hour clock and seven-day week
 are unchanged.
